      "notes": "Operator-run explicit local setup of the test runtimes that workspace_verify_proof native proofs need (runners node-test, jest, vitest, mocha, ava, deno, lib0-testing, pytest, stestr, go-test, cargo-test) in an existing repository. It installs missing selected Node, Python, Go, Rust/Cargo or Deno toolchains at supported pinned versions into an explicit toolchain root, prepares lockfile-pinned project test dependencies with the standard package manager into launcher-owned state, verifies every component inside the launcher sandbox and only then publishes .agent-launch/test-runtimes/readiness.v1.json. Omitting --runner repeats the published selection; a failed or partial run withdraws readiness. It does not rerun wiki bootstrap or touch root agent guidance, and proof attempts never download or install anything."
